00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.760
Okay, let's give it a try!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:06.590
Let's do it!

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:07.350
Let's do it!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:07.890
