00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.890
That's right.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:28.640
Is the egg in the back of the ship yours?

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.470
Yes, it's the egg of Mothra.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:32.950
