00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.350
And in the next typhoon,

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.650
the egg of Mothra was washed away in the sea for the mountain tsunami.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.540
It's been in our blood for years and years.

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:00.870
It's a big egg.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.980
I have no hope to live in the island of the island.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.200
Please bring the eggs.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:42.940
Can you hear the people on the island?

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:53.480
They're praying for the eggs to return safely.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.160
Because the ownership of eggs is a happy business.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.450
I went to ask for it and met a terrible woman.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.100
There's no way they'll listen to us.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:34.850
What happens if we don't give them the eggs?

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:38.030
If we give them the eggs, they'll be born.

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:40.590
And then they'll go back to the Infant Island on their own.

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:44.280
But then they'll cause trouble for everyone.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:45.900
Trouble?

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.390
It's not that they'll do it in a bad way,

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:51.040
but when they walk in search of food,

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:51.840
