00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.780
I don't want to cause such a fight.

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.590
The Infant Islanders love peace.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.480
I'm begging you. Please lend me your phone.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.830
