00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.150
It's right next to you.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.860
What? You want me to return the eggs?

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.130
Don't make such a big deal out of it.

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.590
I'm not making a big deal out of it.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:08.670
